    "description": "Discover the hidden potential of 719-721 Anza St, Lone Mountain, San Francisco! This charming duplex w/ 2 car side by side parkings, located a block from the historic Lone Mountain College, has been lovingly maintained by the same family for over 40 years and has been owner-occupied. Light-filled flat offers 2 bed1 bath, seamlessly combining timeless character w/modern updates. The kitchens in both units have been refreshed, with the vacant unit boasting brand-new appliances and countertops. The bathrooms have been tastefully refurbished, preserving their classic charm while ensuring modern comfort.Located near the University of San Francisco, St. Mary\u2019s Hospital, California Pacific Medical Center, Rossi Park, and Golden Gate Park, this property is perfect for both homeowners and investors. It offers flexible living arrangements, rental income potential, and the exciting possibility of condo conversion. Enjoy the convenience of nearby shopping and dining at Laurel Village Mall, Target, and the vibrant restaurants of Clement St. Transportation is effortless with SFMTA bus stops on Geary Blvd & Balboa St. just a block away. Union Square is a quick 15-minute drive, and Baker Beach, Ocean Beach, and the Presidio Golf Course are all easily accessible. Don\u2019t miss this rare opportunity."
  },
